    "speaker_name": "",
    "speaker_position": "center",
    "text": "很久以前，世界上有一座知识神塔。塔上每一层，都是一门学问。词灵在金光里飞舞，孩子们抬头仰望，眼里写满好奇。",
    "text_speed": 30.0,
    "transition_in": "fade",
    "transition_out": "fade",
    "advance_on": "click",
    "next_panel_id": "intro_2",
    "lore_codex_id": "lore_intro_1",
    "tags": ["main_story", "intro"]
  },
  {
    "id": "intro_2",
    "background_image_path": "",
    "background_color": "#3a2a4a",
    "bgm_path": "",
    "speaker_name": "",
    "speaker_position": "center",
    "text": "直到有一天，遗忘之主降临。它不喧嚣、也不嘶吼，只是悄悄从人们心里抽走那些珍贵的字。",
    "text_speed": 30.0,
    "transition_in": "fade",
    "advance_on": "click",
    "next_panel_id": "intro_3",
    "lore_codex_id": "lore_intro_2",
    "tags": ["main_story", "intro"]
  },
  {
    "id": "intro_3",
    "background_image_path": "",
    "background_color": "#1a1a2e",
    "bgm_path": "",
    "speaker_name": "",
    "speaker_position": "center",
    "text": "知识被扭曲，文字变成了怪物，塔身在轰鸣中崩塌。守护者们也一个接一个地沉睡了下去。",
    "text_speed": 30.0,
    "transition_in": "fade",
    "advance_on": "click",
    "next_panel_id": "intro_4",
    "lore_codex_id": "lore_intro_3",
    "tags": ["main_story", "intro"]
  },
  {
    "id": "intro_4",
    "background_image_path": "",
    "background_color": "#2a2a4e",
    "bgm_path": "",
    "speaker_name": "",
    "speaker_position": "center",
    "text": "可是，塔不会真正消失。它在阴影里静静等待——等一个愿意重新登塔的孩子，把沉睡的知识，一层一层唤醒。",
    "text_speed": 30.0,
    "transition_in": "fade",
    "advance_on": "click",
    "next_panel_id": "intro_5",
    "lore_codex_id": "lore_intro_4",
    "tags": ["main_story", "intro"]
  },
  {
    "id": "intro_5",
    "background_image_path": "",
    "background_color": "#1a3a3a",
    "bgm_path": "",
    "portrait_left_path": "",
    "portrait_left_emotion": "normal",
    "speaker_name": "词语之师",
    "speaker_position": "left",
    "text": "孩子，从今天起，你就是新一代的守护者。我会陪着你，从最底的字母厅走起。准备好了吗？",
    "text_speed": 30.0,
    "transition_in": "fade",
